# =============================================================================
# Raw Data & Binaries (Tambahan Penting)
# =============================================================================
# data/raw/ holds the source papers. Ignored on purpose: ~7 PDFs, tens of MB.
# Consequence: chunks_semantic*.json cannot be regenerated from a fresh clone,
# which is why the processed JSON above IS committed. See the note there.
# Bare `data/raw` (no trailing slash) so `git check-ignore data/raw` matches too.
data/raw
*.zip

